---
description: Medium or large feature implementation, formal algorithm work, multi-file changes, tickets, handoffs, plans, or work based on an approved ticket
globs:
  - "agent/tickets/**"
  - "agent/handoffs/**"
  - "agent/plans/**"
  - "agent/specs/**"
  - "project/src/**"
  - "project/tests/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow:

@agent/workflows/feature-development.md
@agent/templates/ticket.md
@agent/templates/handoff.md

Before implementation:

1. inspect Git state;
2. locate the approved ticket;
3. read relevant formal sources and project decisions;
4. produce a bounded implementation plan;
5. identify blocking ambiguity;
6. obtain human approval for substantial work.

Implement only the approved scope.

Do not commit or push unless explicitly authorised.
